t grove shudders. A darkness creeps through the roots, twisting all it touches."},{"id":"intro-cam-2","kind":"camera","t":6.295,"dur":2.2,"tx":30,"tz":42,"radius":95,"alpha":0.35},{"id":"intro-hold-3","kind":"hold","t":8.495000000000001,"dur":0.4},{"id":"intro-line-4","kind":"line","t":8.895000000000001,"dur":2.5,"speaker":"Stumpey","text":"Big problems... we oughtta get outta here.","style":"scared"},{"id":"intro-line-5","kind":"line","t":11.395000000000001,"dur":2.915,"speaker":"Lady","text":"What is happening to the forest? I can feel it dying.","style":"whisper"},{"id":"intro-line-6","kind":"line","t":14.310000000000002,"dur":3.96,"speaker":"Doc","text":"Something has poisoned the heartwood. There is no curing this from here.","style":"think"},{"id":"intro-line-7","kind":"line","t":18.270000000000003,"dur":3.08,"speaker":"Goblin","text":"Less talking, more running! North, through the old pass!","style":"shout"},{"id":"intro-line-8","kind":"line","t":21.35,"dur":2.5,"speaker":"Stumpey","text":"Right. Stay close everyone. Move!","style":"command"}]},{"id":"ending","when":"win","duration":22.120000000000005,"clips":[{"id":"ending-cam-0","kind":"camera","t":0,"dur":1.2,"tx":30,"tz":40,"radius":100,"alpha":0.3},{"id":"ending-line-1","kind":"line","t":1.2,"dur":2.5,"speaker":"Stumpey","text":"We made it...","style":"whisper"},{"id":"ending-line-2","kind":"line","t":3.7,"dur":2.5,"speaker":"Lady","text":"But look behind us...","style":"scared"},{"id":"ending-cam-3","kind":"camera","t":6.2,"dur":2.6,"tx":30,"tz":24,"radius":145,"alpha":-2.15},{"id":"ending-line-4","kind":"line","t":8.8,"dur":2.53,"speaker":"Doc","text":"All those towers... everything we built. Gone.","style":"think"},{"id":"ending-hold-5","kind":"hold","t":11.33,"dur":0.8},{"id":"ending-line-6","kind":"line","t":12.13,"dur":2.5,"speaker":"Goblin","text":"No use cryin' about it. What's ahead?"},{"id":"ending-line-7","kind":"line","t":14.63,"dur":2.5,"speaker":"Stumpey","text":"The old road. Nobody's used it in ages."},{"id":"ending-line-8","kind":"line","t":17.130000000000003,"dur":3.19,"text":"The party turns north, leaving the corrupted grove behind."},{"id":"ending-hold-9","kind":"hold","t":20.320000000000004,"dur":1.8}]}]},"lt":{"e":2.15,"c":1.3,"k":[0.27,0.45,0.66],"b":[["sun",56,36,1.85],["hemi",236,68,0.34]]},"ncb":1,"mt":"adventure","pk":{"files":["chapter1.garden","chapter2.garden","chapter3.garden","Chapter_6.garden","Chapter_4.garden"]}}}}